2Jryy8_HQOZNkrQZzBUyLT1kHnZ9nP5nop8aihHw&oe=6B0840A2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "160732235031751", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974579_2097317323685146_8736316079699132416_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sYXhC5x5cN4Q7kNvwHU4rlw&_nc_oc=AdrJ3Aycy-HUTTxzPDsWydaS-Dsj4477xxbJgcZlwSBSIM5yg7Lfmn7jzpz31opVmgw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTzh5CIaux0xpXHS_f9oetaf9GJp1y7-NGhz1c4ey7-ng&oe=6B08423B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Anceder", "keywords": ["shoot", "arcade", "space", "bullet", "shmup"], "long_description": "Bienvenue in the arcade shoot-them-up (shmup, bullet hell). Choose your ship and try to make the best score.\n\nThe \"MORE\" Update : Now with more bonus, more sounds, more languages (Spanish & Chinese texts), more fun ! The Fury mode is now easier.\n\n- Play the five worlds in a row to make a high score.\n- Original musics in HD. Music are level-long (no repetitive loops).\n- Normal and hard mode. You will make huge scores in hard mode.\n\n- Try the fury mode for an even faster game. \n- Optimized for Oculus Go.\n- Playable with joypad or remote.\n- Scores saved worldwide (if connected to the internet). You can set initials to each score to compare with your visiting friends.\n- You can play lying in bed (see options menu or pause menu).\n\nA bug or idea ? Please write to cedric@anceder.com or twitter @ancedergame", "short_description": "Dive in the arcade shoot-them-up (shmup, shoot'em up, bullet hell). A lot of action is awaiting you. \"Insert coin\" and jump in the shmup !"}]}, "developer_name": "C\u00e9dric Andreu", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.noixdecroco.com/ancedermbr/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.anceder.com/anceder", "publisher_name": "C\u00e9dric Andreu", "support_website_url": "http://contact.anceder.com/", "website_url": "http://w